    <description>This flow automates the complete lifecycle management of Consultant records, from creation and history tracking to inactivation and reactivation. It ensures proper record handling by updating relevant fields, clearing employment history links, and sending notifications based on specific status changes, providing a unified and streamlined process for managing consultant data.


Consultant History Record Creation   ---  Consultant History Record Creation on Contact Type &apos;Consultant&apos; creation.
Contact Inactivation Process   ---  This process fires when the contact Record is made inactive.
Contact Reactivation Process  ---  Update the related active contact lookup field, consultant history records with the reactivated contact id.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
